       "title": "Chemical reactions from US patents (1976-Sep2016)"
      }
     ],
     "descriptions": [
      {
       "description": "Reactions extracted by text-mining from United States patents published between 1976 and September 2016. The reactions are available as CML or reaction SMILES. Note that the reactions SMILES are derived from the CML. The files can be unzipped using a program like 7-Zip.<br><br>The reactions were extracted using an enhanced version of the reaction extraction code described in https://www.repository"
      }
